Package: SIRAP
Title: Spatial Immune Receptor Analysis and Processing
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Hunter J.", "Melton", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "Hunter.J.Melton@dartmouth.edu")
  )
Author: Hunter J. Melton [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Hunter J. Melton <Hunter.J.Melton@dartmouth.edu>
Description: Spatial Immune Receptor Analysis and Processing. How sweet is
    that? Utilities for processing, visualizing, and lightly analyzing long-read
    spatial BCR and TCR sequencing data. The package focuses on AIRR-style
    rearrangement tables with spatial barcodes and coordinates, with helpers
    for Visium HD barcode mapping, pRESTO/IgBLAST shell pipeline generation,
    clonal summaries, Seurat clone assays, and tree plotting.
